{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3a754b45-68d0-4cb2-ae71-fba8fcea8026",
    "name": "QOR API — MVP Core",
    "description": "Postman collection covering every route registered in qor-api as of Phase 4 (Event Lifecycle & Admin Tools) — 34 routes across routes/api_v1.php (fan-facing, /api/v1/*) and routes/api_admin_v1.php (admin surface, /api/admin/v1/*). See ARCHITECTURE.md §8.9.\n\nAuth: fan-guarded routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{fan_token}}`; admin-guarded routes (including Super-Admin-only approval routes) use `Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}`. Public routes need no Authorization header. Obtain a fan token via 'Login (Fan)' (or 'Register (Fan)' + login); an admin token currently has no dedicated admin-login endpoint in this phase — paste one obtained through your own admin auth flow into the `admin_token` variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fan_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
